This is a test of pattern matching and transforming

	target match_string

Read a string from the environment.  This is "hello.world"

		env "INBOUND" => entry
		show (regex.match entry "[a-z]+\.[a-z]+")
		show (regex.match entry "[0-9]+")

	target replace_string

		env "INBOUND" => entry
		show (regex.replace entry "([a-z]+)\.([a-z]+)" "\{^2}\{^1}")
		show (regex.replace entry "([a-z]+)\.([a-z]+)" "maybe \{2}-\{^^1}.")